# Shoot4Fun — environment variables
#
# The backend reads DATABASE_URL from the environment. Without it the
# leaderboard is in-memory (INT-017 uses an in-process fixture for the
# per-claim test). The platform mints pg-app-shoot4fun via the onboarding
# database grant and injects DATABASE_URL via the Helm chart.
#
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://pg-app-shoot4fun@pg-cluster:5432/shoot4fun
#
# System test accounts. Setting SYSTEM_ACCOUNT_PASSWORD is the one switch:
# at every boot the named accounts (SYSTEM_ACCOUNTS, default carter,katael)
# are pinned to that password - created if missing, digest restated if not -
# so the admin password always opens them. Unset means no system accounts.
#
# SYSTEM_ACCOUNT_PASSWORD=change-me
# SYSTEM_ACCOUNTS=carter,katael
